               <desc xml:lang="en">Abstract</desc>
               <note corresp="http://syriaca.org/nhsl" xml:id="" xml:lang="en" type="abstract" resp="http://syriaca.org">
                  <Cyril of Alexandria composed 156 Homilies on Luke, which in Syriac translation are known together as a commentary. The Syriac translation is incomplete and the textual history of the work is complex. Individual homilies have their own reception across Syriac florilegia and collections.>
